<title>USA: Jacor Communications Inc Q4 net falls.</title>
<headline>Jacor Communications Inc Q4 net falls.</headline>
<dateline>CINCINNATI 1997-02-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr			  $0.01		    $0.16</p>
<p> Net			    368		    3,197</p>
<p> Revs			96,241		   31,715</p>
<p> Avg shrs		  32,827		   20,244</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: Q4 Broadcast cash flow $36.9 million vs $9.7 million.</p>
<p>Revenues are after paying agency commissions. Broadcast revenues before commissions were $108.3 million vs $35.5 million.  </p>
<p>	  YEAR</p>
<p> Shr			  $0.19		    $0.52</p>
<p> Net			  5,105		   10,965</p>
<p> Revs		     223,761		  118,891</p>
<p> Avg shrs		  26,830		   20,913</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: Year broadcast cash flow $72.7 million vs $31.6 million.</p>
<p>Year broadcast revenues before agency commissions were $250.5 million vs $133.1 million.</p>
<p>1996 year includes extraordinary charge of $3.0 million, or $0.11 a share.</p>
<p>1996 year and Q4 include non-recurring bonus payment of $2.3 million.</p>
</text>
